{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"连通-截断分解"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"(n-连通, n-截断) 分解"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>在 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 以及一般的 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":"中, 对每个整数 $n\\geq -2$, 有一个"},{"Local":{"url":"正交分解系","text":"正交分解系"}},{"Plain":" ($n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":", $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"). 特别地, 任一态射 $f \\colon X \\to Y$ 均可唯一地分解为\n$$\r\nX \\to Z \\to Y,\r\n$$\n其中</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X\\to Z$ 是 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"映射;</li>\n<li>$Z\\to Y$ 是 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"映射.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对观点"}},{"Plain":"看, $Z\\to Y$ 就是 $X\\to Y$ 在相对于 $Y$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"俯意象","text":"俯意象"}},{"Plain":"中的 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>进一步, 所有这些分解可以连成一个序列 ("},{"Local":{"url":"滤过","text":"滤对象"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\nX \\to \\cdots Z_n \\to Z_{n-1} \\cdots \\to Z_{-2} = Y,\r\n$$</p>\n<p>它是相对于 $Y$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"俯意象","text":"俯意象"}},{"Plain":"中的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov 塔"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>$n=-2$:</p>\n<p>态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 的 ($(-2)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":", $(-2)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":") 分解为\n$$\r\nX \\to Y \\overset{\\mathrm{id}}{\\to} Y.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通性"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断性"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"正交分解系","text":"正交分解系"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov 塔"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"Whitehead塔","text":"Whitehead 塔"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}